      <!--Q#9-->
      <exercise>
        <problem>
          <para>Using desmos, adjust the slope and/or the \(y\)-intercept to find an inequality that
            could be a possibility.</para>

        </problem>
        <solution>
          <para>Compare your answer:</para>
          <para>Answers may vary.</para>
          <para>These are possible representation of where the line could on the graph</para>
     
          <para><emphasis>Less than</emphasis> \(y&lt;2x\)</para>
            <figure class="">
              <media alt="Insert Alt Text">
                <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_15_09_06.png" />
